Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.65,0:00:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya Yu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.19,0:00:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-Gi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.83,0:01:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My sword hunter will demolish\Nyour dino in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.99,0:01:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sword hunter, attack now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.01,0:01:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the stuff. Nice shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.27,0:01:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go. What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.81,0:01:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have school?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.05,0:01:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, some of us have to\Nactually get to work. Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.75,0:01:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, pal, but you'll have to back it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.91,0:01:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The road's closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.89,0:01:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.83,0:01:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This section of the city is shut down\Nfor the Kaiba Corporation's big event.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.11,0:01:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tough break.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.21,0:01:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But what kind of event could\Ntake over the whole city?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.65,0:01:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, Kaiba's Battle City Duel\NMonsters Tournament, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.39,0:01:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That is absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.27,0:01:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, just doing my job, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.55,0:01:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So please move your car. Yeah, will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.27,0:01:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle City Tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.95,0:01:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut down the city. For this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.99,0:02:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The rare hunter's hideout. We're\Njust about 11 miles away. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.59,0:02:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,exactly where those creeps are\Nkeeping Taya And Joey should be nearby
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.21,0:02:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get them both out of there\Nin no time I'm concerned with more
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.01,0:02:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,important issues Like finding the\Nthird Egyptian god card Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.15,0:02:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, who exactly is this Marek?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.47,0:02:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He leads the rare hunters, but\Nwhat else do you know about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.55,0:02:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've never actually seen his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.59,0:02:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know that he possesses a Millennium\NItem much like my own Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.95,0:02:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Those again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.49,0:02:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare me the bogus magic talk, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.23,0:02:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, you have already experienced the\Ngreat power of a Millennium Item firsthand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.79,0:02:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Or have you forgotten about\NPegasus and his Millennium Eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.77,0:02:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Kaiba, time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.01,0:02:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The curry box!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.05,0:03:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Emerge and attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.57,0:03:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no more cards you can\Nplay, therefore you lose, Kaiba boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.03,0:03:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And you've lost much more than\Njust this duel, haven't you, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.71,0:03:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost the only chance you\Nhad at rescuing your baby brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.81,0:03:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You let him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.71,0:03:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, my dear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.85,0:03:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I will spare you the agony of\Ncarrying on in this world without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.61,0:03:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.03,0:03:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the final fate of\Nyour soul, Seto Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.63,0:03:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Experience the power of my millennium eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.47,0:03:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to your new home, a\Nplace of solitude and seclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.69,0:03:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And while your soul is away, your body\Nwill be employed as my obedient servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.11,0:04:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That was just a cheap trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.79,0:04:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But Seto, Pegasus did use his\NMillennium Eye to trap us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.95,0:04:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.95,0:04:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Just drop it, Mukuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.39,0:04:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You can believe whatever you choose,\Nbut I assure you my puzzle is no trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.99,0:04:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not exactly who\Nyou think I am, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.39,0:04:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I am actually a 5,000-year-old spirit who
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.19,0:04:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,lives within the chambers\Nof the Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.13,0:04:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.45,0:04:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly expect me to believe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.71,0:04:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.47,0:04:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,At one time, I lived in Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.89,0:04:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It was there I ruled as pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.81,0:04:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,As pharaoh? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.41,0:04:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what that woman told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.87,0:04:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.87,0:04:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Pharaoh's story's not true.\NThere's just no way that woman is Shizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.93,0:04:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,told me the same lie at the museum
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.93,0:05:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,it can't be these
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.93,0:05:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,carvings look like
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.87,0:05:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,dual monster cards there's a theory\Nthat in ancient times these monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.73,0:05:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,were real egyptian sorcerers summoned\Nmonsters to earth to do their
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.59,0:05:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,bidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But they soon realized that the\Nmonsters could not be controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.69,0:05:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They destroyed countless villages and\Nbrought earth to the brink of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.99,0:05:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The citizens turned to\Nthe pharaoh for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.55,0:05:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Though he could not permanently\Ndefeat the monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.13,0:05:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,he managed to use his magic to seal
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.95,0:05:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,them away in stone tablets and\Nbrought peace to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,However, over time,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.25,0:05:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,evil sorcerers learned how to control the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.61,0:05:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters and release\Nthem from the tablets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.91,0:05:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,With their army of powerful monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.17,0:05:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,the sorcerers were confident that\Nno one could stand in their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.39,0:05:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They betrayed the pharaoh and\Nwaged an all-out war against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.19,0:05:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the one you must look at.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.65,0:05:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This carving is the reason\NI've called you here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It depicts one of the\Nmain conflicts in the war
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.03,0:06:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,between the pharaoh and\Nhis greatest opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.39,0:06:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the pharaoh, but that's Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.71,0:06:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,On the left is the sorcerer fighting\Nagainst him that's you kaiba if you still
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.25,0:06:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,have any doubt look at his monster it's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.43,0:06:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,the blue eyes white dragon you pharaoh
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.99,0:06:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,what a joke i spoke to that crazy\Nwoman also yugi but unlike you i didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.69,0:06:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,buy into her story look what ashizu
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.07,0:06:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,said was true i know it the events of the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.87,0:06:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Past will occur once again and that\Nsame great evil will return to threaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.55,0:06:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Us? I know who I must stop and I'll never
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.59,0:06:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,forget the day i first heard his name
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.89,0:06:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,i summon exodia's head in defense mode\Nnow you can't strike my life points
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.75,0:06:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,that's exactly what i wanted you to do
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.95,0:06:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,rare hunter now it's\Ntime for me to destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.91,0:07:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.49,0:07:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You activated my trap card!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.39,0:07:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A costly mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.95,0:07:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Chain destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.07,0:07:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It struck my deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.81,0:07:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,While it can't destroy your Exodia\Nhead on the field, it can destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.31,0:07:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,the ones in your hand and your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.81,0:07:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.75,0:07:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My Exodia heads are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.73,0:07:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He found a way to stop\Nthe unstoppable Exodia!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.39,0:07:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not through, Rare Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.85,0:07:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.76,0:07:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monsters are trapped in\Nmy Swords of Revealing Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.37,0:07:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Dust Tornado!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.73,0:07:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This trap destroys one magic card,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,shattering your Swords of Revealing\NLight, which allows my monsters to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.37,0:07:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my monsters, attack the\Nrare hunter's length point!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Yugi, you won!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.73,0:08:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No, please don't be angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.47,0:08:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, don't! Please! Spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.03,0:08:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We meet again, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.37,0:08:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.63,0:08:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.73,0:08:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it you want from me, Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.83,0:08:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I want what belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.35,0:08:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll take it using the\Nstrength of the Egyptian god cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.51,0:08:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Egyptian what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.55,0:08:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But millennia ago, a trio of powerful\Nbehemoths rampaged throughout ancient Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,These Egyptian god monsters spread\Ndestruction throughout the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.53,0:09:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,When Pegasus created dual monsters, he\Nresurrected these mighty beasts as cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.55,0:09:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,With these Egyptian gods, I can destroy\Nyou and claim the power I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.23,0:09:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never claim the Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.71,0:09:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You misunderstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.03,0:09:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more than the power of the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.55,0:09:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I want the Pharaoh's power, the boundless\Nenergy of the ancient ruler himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.65,0:09:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,With it, no one will stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.19,0:09:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use the almighty magic I gained\Nto conquer and lead the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.95,0:09:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.47,0:09:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The end is near, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.61,0:09:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.95,0:09:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.83,0:09:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek wants to rule the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.59,0:09:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And he thinks getting\Nall three Egyptian god
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.21,0:09:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,cards will give him the\Npower he needs to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.83,0:09:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that explains\Nwhy he's going through
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.07,0:09:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,all this trouble just to\Nget his hands on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.61,0:10:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.75,0:10:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, do me a favor and stop corrupting\Nmy brother's mind with your lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.13,0:10:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.61,0:10:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And you've heard Merrick's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.43,0:10:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,First hand. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.61,0:10:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet your maker, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.67,0:10:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The last monster you'll ever see, the\NEgyptian god Slifer the Sky Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.65,0:10:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,you're finished yugi prepare to\Nfeel his wrath how can i stop it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.39,0:10:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,behold the ultimate five card\Ncombination that makes me completely
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.65,0:10:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,indestructible My Egyptian god card\Nwill continue to grow stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.69,0:10:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and your attacks are completely useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.37,0:10:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.37,0:10:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let Merrick win my puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.77,0:10:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on your feet, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.63,0:11:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.15,0:11:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when do you bow to your rivals?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.71,0:11:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.62,0:11:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you still have what it takes,\Nthen get up and prove it to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.35,0:11:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I will defeat him, Kaiba, I\Nassure you. Marek, it's over! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.51,0:11:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My Egyptian God card is unstoppable\NNow watch as my plan to slay
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.27,0:11:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,your so-called indestructible\Ndragon begin I'm ready for your
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.51,0:11:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic attack. Observe the\Nmagic card Brain Control. Now I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.77,0:11:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,control your monster My Brain Control\Ncard will seize your Revival Jam
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.83,0:11:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.71,0:11:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever Revival Jam reappears on the\Nfield, my dragon automatically attacks it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.59,0:11:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And since Yami controls Revival Jam,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.95,0:11:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,it will revive itself on his side of the\Nfield, which makes me draw three new cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.99,0:11:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then my dragon will attack again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.39,0:11:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Each event triggers the next\Nin a never-ending cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.85,0:12:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you run out of cards to draw,\Nyou will automatically lose this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.85,0:12:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.13,0:12:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I win. It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.23,0:12:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Silly fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.49,0:12:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, you'll meet me\Nsooner than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.59,0:12:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way to Battle City as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.99,0:12:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I'm there, the next\Nphase of my plan begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.43,0:12:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you the power of\Nthe Pharaoh will be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.89,0:12:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I have rare hunters everywhere in\NBattle City, and I can see all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.81,0:12:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I see the Millennium\NPuzzle that will be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.41,0:12:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I see a defenseless city\Nwaiting to be conquered!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.41,0:12:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And I see potential mine\Nslaves in every crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.55,0:12:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm always searching for new servants\Nto add to my army of rare hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.27,0:12:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who'll be next.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I can use your friends\Nto get what I want from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.95,0:12:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You leave them alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.37,0:12:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If any harm befalls my friends,\Nyou will regret it, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.17,0:13:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as my dragon's one\Nweakness destroyed it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.17,0:13:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,your loyalty to your friends\Nwill soon destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.85,0:13:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Using magic powers to\Ncontrol people's minds, I
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.33,0:13:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,bet you still believe in\Nthe Tooth Fairy as well
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.05,0:13:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's powers are very real and\Nvery dangerous. And now that he's
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.59,0:13:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,captured my friends There's no\Ntelling what he plans to do with them
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.59,0:13:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, Joey Take your red eyes back
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.53,0:13:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, Yug You hold on to it\NIt isn't mine to take, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.61,0:13:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You want it fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.67,0:13:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, the Rare Hunters have\Ncollected tons of rare cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.01,0:13:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Their decks are totally souped up, so I\Nknow that they're going to be tough to beat,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,even for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.31,0:13:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.03,0:13:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying, one day you'll need all\Nthe powerful monsters you can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.53,0:13:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, you can think of me\Nwhenever you play my red eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.87,0:13:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the least I can do to repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.43,0:14:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always had my back, so it's\Ntime I helped you for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.27,0:14:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I want you to keep\Nmy Red-Eyes Black Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.67,0:14:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's gonna come in\Nhandy for you sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.71,0:14:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, this means that a part\Nof me will be a part of your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.55,0:14:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kinda cool knowing that\NI'm helping you save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.03,0:14:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take good care of\Nyour Red-Eyes Black Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.87,0:14:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it. It's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.75,0:14:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a true friend, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.89,0:14:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And together we can take on\Nany evil that comes our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.53,0:14:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to locate my friends\Nas soon as possible and get
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.81,0:14:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,them away from that madman
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.49,0:14:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,before it's too late we're only
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.83,0:14:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,two miles from our target guys\Ngood then it won't be long
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.27,0:14:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,before we find teya and joey\Ni'm tired of hearing about your
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.09,0:14:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,friends yuki especially that\Nhack wheeler joey has become
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.27,0:14:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,an extremely skilled duelist\Nkaiba in fact i wouldn't be
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,surprised if he had already\Nqualified for the battle city
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.97,0:15:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,finals roba check this out yes
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.17,0:15:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,the magic card roulette spider
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.33,0:15:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,roulette spider attached to\Njinzo ah what's that what's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.95,0:15:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,the point of all this my spider\Nwill spin jinzo round and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,round like a giant wheel when\Nyou tell it to stop it'll
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.13,0:15:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,automatically attack whichever\Ntarget the arrow's pointed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.07,0:15:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, roulette spider! Spin now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.19,0:15:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.59,0:15:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinto! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.29,0:15:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinto's pointing to my reflex\Nbounder, and if it attacks...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.83,0:15:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They're both doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.39,0:16:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished, and this duel is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.67,0:16:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.17,0:16:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a tough duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.89,0:16:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But since I won, time to\Nhand over your rarest card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.71,0:16:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, my Jinzo and my Locator card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.41,0:16:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.15,0:16:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give up, Wheeler. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.69,0:16:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler doesn't quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.63,0:16:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'd understand if you had friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.41,0:16:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.45,0:16:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.75,0:16:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face down, then\Nsummon Gear Freed the Iron Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.29,0:16:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.61,0:16:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Once your knight has been\Ninfected by my Parasite card,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll just be another snack\Nfor my ravenous queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.79,0:16:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sure about that, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.41,0:16:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Some cards are bug-proof. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.47,0:16:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't the parasite feed on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.29,0:17:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He's Gearfree, the Iron Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.15,0:17:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And that slimy parasite's\Nhelpless against his metal armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.31,0:17:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Gearfree, the Iron Knight, attack his\Nqueen's eggs, and lower her attack power!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.07,0:17:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.21,0:17:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Next turn, you're bug food!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.13,0:17:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.87,0:17:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, my lovely queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.67,0:17:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,destroy his scrap heap of a knight\Nand what's left of his life point!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.67,0:17:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You grub, I was hoping you\Nwould attack me. You were?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.71,0:17:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All part of my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.79,0:17:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate the trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.63,0:17:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Grave robber!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.71,0:17:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Grave Robber. Yep,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.65,0:17:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,he can take a card from\Nyour graveyard and use it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.07,0:17:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,against you And he just\Nnabbed you a can of aerosol
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.27,0:17:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to exterminate your queen
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.39,0:18:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there goes my best problem\NWhat have you done to my queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.45,0:18:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.69,0:18:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not true with you\Nyet, Weevil Underpants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.99,0:18:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Gearfield, destroy his last egg\Nand the rest of his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.77,0:18:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Loserville, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.07,0:18:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Population, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.51,0:18:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.01,0:18:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.19,0:18:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Weevil, cough him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.25,0:18:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the Insect Queen\Nand two Locator Cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.87,0:18:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Any last words?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.05,0:18:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, six.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.25,0:18:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.35,0:18:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll play this, Return of the Doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.75,0:18:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It brings back one of my monsters\Nand hides it under water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.27,0:18:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.41,0:18:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.11,0:18:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant True Name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.59,0:18:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This card sends all magic and trap cards
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.65,0:18:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,back to the player's\Nhands and off the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.53,0:18:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So I could use it to dry\Nup Mako's ocean and expose
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.53,0:18:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever monster he brought\Nback from his graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:19:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Giant True Name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.39,0:19:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Drain the scene!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.15,0:19:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.63,0:19:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I play scapegoat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.01,0:19:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And I sacrifice one of them so\Nmy panther warrior can attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.03,0:19:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.25,0:19:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that was an excellent duel.\NCongratulations. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.73,0:19:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Here are my two rarest cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.77,0:19:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And two locator cards. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.07,0:19:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.75,0:19:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.45,0:19:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll treat it with respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.93,0:19:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.19,0:19:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And best of luck in the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.67,0:19:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to worry, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.63,0:19:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll set you free.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.21,0:19:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the rare hunter's hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.49,0:19:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.81,0:19:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin our descent immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.35,0:20:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.17,0:20:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.09,0:20:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens down there,\NI'm not leaving without my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.15,0:20:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this, Merrick!
